'''Red Marron''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that could be obtained during the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Battle Cats]] x [[Million Arthur Collaboration Event|Million Arthur]] x [[Dragon Poker Collaboration Event|Dragon Poker]] collaboration event. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.4 Update|Version 2.2.4]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 102
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Red Marron
|name2 = Red Marron CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Red Marron CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Very similar to [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]] in terms of usage. Cheap and expendable, it can be summoned in mass to take hits in place of other, more important units. This meatshield role is quite valuable, if not for the wide selection of cats able to perform this role. Red Marron, however, can be used in {{4c}} stages, where there is considerably less competition.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

